css34: admin menu groups for terrorists and counter-terrorists

configs/adminmenu_grouping.txt ships "Terrorists" (@t) and
"Counter-Terrorists" (@ct) commented out, for servers that are not CS:S or do
not run the cstrike extension. Every css34 package is CS:S and ships
game.cstrike, which registers @t / @ct (CommandTargetProcessor, no engine
guard), so the groups are on.

diff --git a/configs/adminmenu_grouping.txt b/configs/adminmenu_grouping.txt
index 84e6e29f2a59f75353d5dc62489f35c544111c22..2a88e28c617ef146d36baeb1cf3e5debace14f2c 100644
--- a/configs/adminmenu_grouping.txt
+++ b/configs/adminmenu_grouping.txt
@@ -13,8 +13,7 @@ Groups
 	"Humans"				"@humans"
 	"Current aim"			"@aim"
 
-	/* You can enable these if you are using Counter-Strike Source and running the cstrike extension */
-//	"Terrorists"			"@t"
-//	"Counter-Terrorists"	"@ct"
+	"Terrorists"			"@t"
+	"Counter-Terrorists"	"@ct"
 
 }
\ No newline at end of file
